### 阶段 18 知识空间与成员治理接口示例
@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@userToken = replace-with-user-token
@adminToken = replace-with-admin-token
@globalSpaceId = 00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000001
@spaceId = replace-with-space-uuid
@memberUserId = replace-with-user-uuid

### 普通用户查询可读的活动空间；GLOBAL 固定排在最前
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-spaces?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 查询空间详情；无权访问受限空间时与不存在统一返回 404
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-spaces/{{globalSpaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{userToken}}

### 管理员按状态、可见性和代码或名称关键字筛选空间
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-spaces?status=ACTIVE&visibility=RESTRICTED&keyword=OPS&page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 管理员创建默认 RESTRICTED、ACTIVE 的普通空间
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/knowledge-spaces
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: space-create-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "code": "TEAM_OPS",
  "name": "运维支持空间",
  "description": "保存运维团队内部排障知识"
}

### 管理员修改名称、说明和可见性；expectedVersion 是当前空间版本
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/knowledge-spaces/{{spaceId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: space-update-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "生产运维支持空间",
  "description": "保存生产运维团队内部排障知识",
  "visibility": "RESTRICTED",
  "expectedVersion": 0
}

### 管理员停用普通空间；GLOBAL 永远不能停用
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/knowledge-spaces/{{spaceId}}/disable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: space-disable-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": 1
}

### 管理员重新启用已停用空间
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/admin/knowledge-spaces/{{spaceId}}/enable
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: space-enable-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": 2
}

### 空间 MANAGER 或平台管理员查询成员；不返回密码和 Token 字段
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-spaces/{{spaceId}}/members?page=1&size=20
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}

### 新增成员；新增时 expectedVersion 省略，已有关系改角色或恢复时必须传当前版本
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-spaces/{{spaceId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: space-member-put-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "role": "MANAGER"
}

### 撤销成员关系；受限空间不能撤销或降级最后一个活动 MANAGER
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/v1/knowledge-spaces/{{spaceId}}/members/{{memberUserId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{adminToken}}
Idempotency-Key: space-member-revoke-001
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "expectedVersion": 0
}
